text.section:
The guidelines shall require the following:

An assessment of state of good repair needs;


A review of the performance of fixed-route bus service, including schedules, route design, connectivity, and vehicle sizes;


An evaluation of opportunities to improve operating efficiency of the transit network, including reliability of trips and travel speed;


An examination and identification of opportunities to share services where multiple transit providers' services overlap; and


An examination of opportunities to improve service in underserved areas.
